  "description": "Shared definitions for the CA/Browser Forum S/MIME Baseline Requirements v1.0.16 Strict and Multipurpose generation subscriber profiles: AlgorithmIdentifier encodings, reserved policy identifiers, and extension blocks reused by the four certificate-type profiles.",
  "org": "cabforum",
  "spec": "smime-br-1.0.16",
  "$defs": {
