          },
          "description": "At least one Mailbox Field SHALL be present as rfc822Name or otherName of type id-on-SmtpUTF8Mailbox. otherName entries are skipped by this tool's pattern matching and cannot be value-checked; any other supported GeneralName type is reported as a mismatch."
